        { "item": "salt", "quantity": "to taste", "source": "Pantry" }
      ],
      "steps": [
        "Preheat oven to 375°F. Boil jumbo shells per package directions until al dente. Drain and set aside.",
        "Dice zucchini finely. Heat olive oil (1 tbsp total for entire recipe) in a large skillet over medium heat.",
        "Add ground turkey and zucchini, cook 8-10 minutes breaking turkey into small pieces until cooked through. Season with garlic powder and salt.",
        "Remove from heat, mix in ricotta cheese. Stir until combined.",
